01:46:44.890 --> 01:46:48.961
>> SAN FRANCISCO IS A CITY THAT UNDERSTANDS THAT CULTURE ISN'T

01:46:48.961 --> 01:46:52.564
ONLY DEFINED BY BUILDINGS OR MONUMENTS BUT THAT THE STORIES

01:46:52.564 --> 01:46:57.172
WE TELL AND THE MEMORIES WE PRESERVE ALSO DO THAT AS WELL.

01:46:57.172 --> 01:47:00.709
HONORING CLAUDE IN THIS WAY ENSURES THAT FUTURE GENERATIONS

01:47:00.709 --> 01:47:03.912
